; Human-owned policy for B3: what a program may request, and what each sink may receive.
; The card's last four digits, and anything computed from them, are personal data: the payment store may hold them, the audit log may not.
; Sinks are deny-by-default. Everything else a refund touches is public or internal.

(policy
  (allow store (ns "payments/*"))
  (allow audit)

  (sink store:payments (accepts pii))
  (sink audit          (accepts internal)))
